<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <head>
    <meta content='text/html; charset=UTF-8' http-equiv='Content-Type' />
    <style>
      body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333; }
      .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px; }
      .header { background-color: #7f1d1d; color: white; padding: 20px; text-align: center; }
      .content { background-color: #f9fafb; padding: 24px; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; }
      .footer { margin-top: 20px; padding-top: 20px; border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb; font-size: 12px; color: #6b7280; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="header">
        <h1>Thank You</h1>
      </div>

      <div class="content">
        <p>Hi <%= @service_request.customer_name.presence || 'there' %>,</p>

        <p>
          Thank you for filling out a service request form. Due to the nature of the service request,
          draft invoices will be shared with you for approval before the service begins.
          Your business is important to us, and we will contact you within 24 hours.
        </p>

        <p>&mdash; The RM Jobsite Solutions Team</p>
      </div>

      <div class="footer">
        <p>This is an automated confirmation from RM Jobsite Solutions. If you have questions, reply to this email or contact support@rmjobsites.com.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
